These files are used under the Mozilla Public License 1.1. The source form of the ported files
is this repository (TextEncodingDetection/Uchardet). UchardetTables.g.cs holds the language
models, frequency tables and state machines of that code, dumped by tools/NppUchardetOracle.

The Notepad++ decision logic around uchardet (Buffer.cpp, Utf8_16.cpp, EncodingMapper.cpp, GPL)
was read and re-implemented; no Notepad++ GPL code is included.

The managed IsTextUnicode statistics test follows the description of ReactOS RtlIsTextUnicode
(sdk/lib/rtl/unicode.c); it is re-written, not copied.

tools/uchardet-upstream-test (not committed; fetched by tools/fetch-uchardet-tests.cmd) is the
test/ folder of https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/uchardet/uchardet (MPL 1.1/GPL 2.0/LGPL 2.1).
